o/13e47133/10/code.py:232:    - Paint surviving cells with `palette[(distance // 2) % len(palette)]`, so every palette entry lasts for two consecutive layers before the cycle advances.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2646:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/9/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D13/0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2647:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2ba387bc/9/code.py:39:   - 原代码的 `sort(key=(row, col))` 假设题目规则就是位置顺序；D2/2 明确破坏了这一点，必须改成按距中心排序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2648:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/21/code.py:318:    Key insight: The marker singletons still encode the color cycle, but now two spatial effects interact: irregular separator blobs distort the outer rings, and interior blocker patches cast directional shadows that stop some frame segments early.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2649:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D2/2+D5/2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2650:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:37:#       Standalone D2/2 idea: only depths 0 and 2 would be colored, once each.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2651:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/4/code.py:43:#       frames rather than part of an infinite modulo cycle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2656:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/5/code.py:34:#        cycle through [7,3,4]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2657:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/13/code.py:2:# combo_spec: D1/1+D2/2+D10/2\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dfadab01/_logs/17.log:2658:/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/23/code.py:31:#        segment, legend order provides the actual palette cycle.\n/home/